# Ultrasonic Sensor with LED

## Aim
To detect an object using an ultrasonic sensor
and glow an LED when an object is detected.

## Components
- Raspberry Pi 4B
- Ultrasonic Sensor HC-SR04
- LED
- Jumper Wires

## Working
The ultrasonic sensor measures the distance.
When an object is detected within 10 cm,
the LED glows.

## Output
LED ON - Object detected.
LED OFF - No object within 10 cm.
